# Analyzing GA Session Data with Malloy

This notebook imports a Malloy model from `./ga_sessions.malloy` and builds a dashboard to show GA session data from many different slices.

The model also makes use of tags for rendering, showing some of the elements as bar charts via the `# bar_chart` tag.
|##

import './ga_sessions.malloy'

source: ga_sessions_tiles is ga_sessions extend {
  view: tile_1 is sessions_dashboard
}
